id: 27
hanzi: 不要紧
pinyin: bú yào jǐn
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Idiom

meanings_summary:
  en: not serious; it doesn't matter; never mind; of no great consequence
  es: no importa; no es grave; no pasa nada; no tiene importancia; no te preocupes

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Idiom | Colloquial | not serious or critical; not a cause for concern or alarm; it doesn't matter | no reviste gravedad ni peligro; no tiene mayor trascendencia; no hay de qué preocuparse | 伤势不要紧 (the injury isn't serious)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 面对手下随从惊恐万状的劝阻，李广将军只是从容一笑，淡淡地说了声“不要紧”，便稳稳拔出长箭。 | Miànduì shǒuxià suícóng jīngkǒng-wànzhuàng de quànzǔ, Lǐ Guǎng jiāngjūn zhǐshì cóngróng yíxiào, dàndàn de shuō le shēng 'búyàojǐn', biàn wěnwěn báchū chángjiàn. | Facing terrified dissuasion from his retinue, General Li Guang merely smiled with composure, murmured 'it doesn't matter', and drew his long arrow. | Ante los asustados ruegos de sus guardias, el general Li Guang sonrió con serenidad, musitó un tranquilo 'no pasa nada' y desenvainó con pulso firme una flecha.
  #2 | 医生仔细检查了伤口后宽慰病人说，只是轻微擦伤，按时换药即可，身体健康完全不要紧。 | Yīshēng zǐxì jiǎnchá le shāngkǒu hòu kuānwèi bìngrén shuō, zhǐshì qīngwēi cāshāng, ànshí huànyào jíkě, shēntǐ jiànkāng wánquán búyàojǐn. | After carefully inspecting the wound, the doctor comforted the patient that it was merely a graze; taking medicine on time, his health was fine. | Tras examinar la herida con detenimiento, el médico tranquilizó al paciente diciéndole que solo era una rozadura leve y que su salud no corría riesgo.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  伤势不要紧 | the injury is not serious
  生病不要紧 | being sick is nothing serious
  失败不要紧 | failure does not matter; it's okay to fail
  不要紧的微恙 | a minor, inconsequential ailment
  安慰说不要紧 | console someone saying it doesn't matter
  完全不要紧 | totally inconsequential; completely fine

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  无关紧要 | wú guān jǐn yào | of no importance; insignificant; immaterial
  紧锣密鼓 | jǐn luó mì gǔ | beating gongs and rolling drums; in intense preparation
  风紧扯呼 | fēng jǐn chě hū | wind is harsh so run; slang for beating a swift retreat
  松紧有度 | sōng jǐn yǒu dù | appropriate balance between looseness and tightness

character_decomposition[3]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  不 | bù | no; not; un-; negative prefix | no; partícula negativa | 一 | one | 一 (heaven boundary / root) | 卜 (calyx / downward shoot) | 4 | 单一结构 | Ancient pictogram of a seed root or plant shoot unable to sprout above the earth line 一, symbolizing negation. | A seed sprout attempts to burst through the ground line (一) but fails to emerge, expressing negation (不). | Un brote que lucha por atravesar la superficie de la tierra (一) sin lograr asomar, indicando negación (不). | 51 | MF | 
  要 | yào | want; need; important; demand | querer; necesitar; esencial | 覀 | west / cover | 覀 (waist of human body / corset) | 女 (nǚ, woman) | 9 | 上下结构 | Ancient pictogram depicting a woman 女 with hands resting on her slender waist 覀. Later borrowed for 'crucial, need, essential'. | A woman (女) holding her essential, delicate waist (覀) represents what is most crucial and required (要). | Una mujer (女) con las manos ceñidas a su cintura esencial (覀) simboliza lo primordial y perentorio (要). | 51 | MWD | 
  紧 | jǐn | tight; strict; urgent; close | apretado; urgente; tenso; estricto | 糸 | silk / thread | 糸 (twisted silk fibers pulled taut) | 臤 (qiān, firm hand / resolute) | 10 | 上下结构 | Simplified from 緊. Ancient pictogram of a resolute hand 臤 pulling strands of silk thread 糸 taut with tension. | Strong hands pull silk cords (糸) with unyielding force to make them extremely taut and urgent (紧). | Manos enérgicas tensan las hebras de seda (糸) con pulso firme hasta dejarlas prietas y urgentes (紧). | 214 | SEVIF | 緊

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Something that is not (不) demanding or crucially urgent (要紧) is lighthearted and doesn't matter (不要紧).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Aquello que no (不) reviste una tensión apremiante (要紧) carece de gravedad y no tiene importancia (不要紧).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: In Chinese colloquial discourse, 要紧 (crucial / tense) derives from 紧 (tight cords pulled to the breaking point). Prefixing with 不 relaxes all existential tension, serving as the quintessential phrase for reassuring anxious peers in crises.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Tone sandhi: 'bú yào jǐn' (35-51-214). 'bù' changes from 4th tone to rising 2nd tone 'bú' because it precedes falling 4th tone 'yào'.

